{
  "_doc": "House sound palette. Every project builds its instruments from this file so all tracks share one sonic identity. FM ops are listed OP1..OP4 (musical order). dt is -3..+3. Edit a patch here => every project picks it up on the next build. Add new patches rather than editing ones that shipped tracks rely on, or bump 'version'.",
